{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":16024,\"date\":\"2026-07-08T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-08T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-beta-3-siri-live-recognition-foto-shortcuts\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 beta 3: Siri più personalizzabile, Live Recognition e novità in Foto e Scorciatoie\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella terza beta di iOS 27 arrivano nuove opzioni per la voce di Siri, una funzione di Live Recognition in Accessibilità, controlli per le valutazioni in Foto e miglioramenti alle Scorciatoie.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/iOS-27-Feature-Dark-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Feature-Dark\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15983,\"date\":\"2026-07-05T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-05T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"rumor-airpods-pro-sviluppo-fotocamera-sospeso\",\"title\":\"Sviluppo AirPods Pro con fotocamera “sospeso”: nuovo rumor\",\"excerpt\":\"Un rumor parla di uno stop nello sviluppo di AirPods Pro dotati di fotocamera. Al momento non ci sono conferme ufficiali, ma la notizia riaccende il dibattito sulle possibili funzioni future degli auricolari.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/airpods-pro-3-pink-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-pink\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15979,\"date\":\"2026-07-05T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-05T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-indizi-nuovo-prodotto-apple-airpods-ultra\",\"title\":\"iOS 27 svela indizi su un nuovo prodotto Apple: possibile pista per AirPods Ultra\",\"excerpt\":\"Nella seconda beta di iOS 27 compaiono riferimenti a un nuovo prodotto Apple non annunciato, identificato da un nome in codice inedito. Tra le ipotesi: le AirPods Ultra.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/airpods-ultra-ios-27-beta-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-ultra-ios-27-beta-2\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15790,\"date\":\"2026-06-27T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-27T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-primo-iphone-pieghevole-aumenti-prezzo\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro e primo iPhone pieghevole: possibili aumenti di prezzo\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor da ambienti cinesi: la gamma iPhone 18 Pro e il primo iPhone pieghevole potrebbero arrivare a prezzi più alti del previsto, con il modello pieghevole che potrebbe superare i 2.000 dollari negli USA.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iphone-17-pro-black-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-pro-black-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15752,\"date\":\"2026-06-25T16:58:15+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-25T14:58:15+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-3-sensore-battito-piu-preciso-smartwatch\",\"title\":\"AirPods Pro 3: il sensore del battito cardiaco è più preciso di ogni smartwatch, tranne Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"AirPods Pro 3 introducono un sensore di frequenza cardiaca integrato e, in test, mostrano una precisione superiore a quella di ogni smartwatch, ad eccezione di Apple Watch.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/airpods-pro-3-sensore-battito-test-apple-watch-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-sensore-battito-test-apple-watch\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15670,\"date\":\"2026-06-22T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-22T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-cinque-nuove-app-siri-ai-remote-find-my-watch-pass-designer\",\"title\":\"Apple presenta cinque nuove app: Siri AI, Remote, Find My su Watch e Pass Designer\",\"excerpt\":\"Da WWDC 2026 arrivano Siri AI con app dedicata, il ritorno di Apple TV Remote, la nuova app Find My su Apple Watch e Pass Designer per Wallet. In parallelo, Claris aggiorna FileMaker Go 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Spotlight-Blue\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15620,\"date\":\"2026-06-20T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-20T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-27-novita-siri-ai-fitness\",\"title\":\"watchOS 27: tutte le novità per Apple Watch, tra Siri AI e nuove funzioni fitness\",\"excerpt\":\"watchOS 27 arriva su Apple Watch in autunno con Siri AI sul polso, una nuova griglia dinamica delle app, miglioramenti a Liquid Glass e funzioni fitness più precise.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/watchOS-27-Hands-On-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchOS-27-Hands-On-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15593,\"date\":\"2026-06-17T13:08:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-17T11:08:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-nuovo-firmware-per-airpods-pro-2-airpods-pro-3-e-beats-studio-buds\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia nuovo firmware per AirPods Pro 2, AirPods Pro 3 e Beats Studio Buds\",\"excerpt\":\"Aggiornamenti firmware disponibili per AirPods Pro 3 (8B41), AirPods Pro 2 (8B39) e Beats Studio Buds (1B211). Ecco come installarli correttamente.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/AirPods-Pro-Firmware-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-Pro-Firmware-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15577,\"date\":\"2026-06-17T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-17T06:44:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-con-fotocamere-arrivo-2027-primo-wearable-ai-apple\",\"title\":\"AirPods con fotocamere in arrivo nel 2027: il primo wearable AI di Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe lavorando a AirPods con fotocamere, pensate non per scattare foto, ma per alimentare Siri con informazioni sull’ambiente. Arrivo previsto tra fine 2027, insieme a iPhone per il 20° anniversario e a un nuovo iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/airpods-pro-3-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-orange\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15499,\"date\":\"2026-06-14T19:14:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-14T17:14:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-celebra-airpods-pro-3-nuovo-spot-cancellazione-rumore-in-ear-mondiali\",\"title\":\"Apple celebra le AirPods Pro 3 con un nuovo spot: la cancellazione del rumore in-ear protagonista ai Mondiali\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple lancia un nuovo spot dedicato alle AirPods Pro 3, mettendo al centro la cancellazione del rumore in-ear e il suo ruolo durante i Mondiali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/airpods-pro-3-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15259,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T14:30:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:39:02+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-macbook-ultra-iphone-pieghevole-novita-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, MacBook Ultra e iPhone pieghevole: le novità in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi leak su Siri in iOS 27, rumor su un possibile “MacBook Ultra”, aggiornamenti su Apple Watch per il monitoraggio glicemico e prime indicazioni sull’iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15218,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T11:00:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-30T10:36:50+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-prepara-iphone-rival-cosa-sappiamo\",\"title\":\"OpenAI prepara un “iPhone rival”: cosa sappiamo finora\",\"excerpt\":\"Un report di Ming-Chi Kuo descrive un possibile smartphone OpenAI come “AI agent phone”, con interfaccia continua e focus su task, non app.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/OpenAI-Smartphone-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"OpenAI-Smartphone-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15126,\"date\":\"2026-05-25T09:30:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-25T06:34:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-rumor-menu-airpods-siri-opzioni-airplay\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, i rumor su menu AirPods, Siri e opzioni AirPlay\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi rumor su iOS 27: menu impostazioni AirPods riorganizzato, miglioramenti a Genmoji e Image Playground, nuove opzioni AirPlay e una nuova interfaccia Siri scura.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15081,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T10:00:18+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T15:58:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-card-wwdc-2026-iphone-pieghevole-top-news-settimana\",\"title\":\"Apple Card, WWDC 2026 e iPhone pieghevole: le top news della settimana\",\"excerpt\":\"Promo Apple Card con AirPods Pro 3 “quasi gratis”, calendario WWDC 2026 dal 8 al 12 giugno e inviti per il keynote. Tra i rumor: iPhone pieghevole e test di ricarica.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/top-stories-2026-05-23-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-23\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15005,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T14:30:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:58:39+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-riorganizza-supervisione-product-design-prima-cambio-ceo\",\"title\":\"Apple riorganizza la supervisione del product design prima del cambio CEO\",\"excerpt\":\"Johny Srouji riorganizza la leadership hardware per avvicinare sviluppo chip e product design. La supervisione passa a Shelly Goldberg e Dave Pakula, mentre Kate Bergeron segue affidabilità e materiali.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Shakes-Up-Oversight-of-Product-Design-Ahead-of-CEO-Change-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Shakes-Up-Oversight-of-Product-Design-Ahead-of-CEO-Change-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14776,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T12:30:51+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:56:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-ue-pairing-come-airpods-notifiche-wearables-terze-parti\",\"title\":\"iOS 26.5: pairing “come AirPods” e notifiche su wearables di terze parti (UE)\",\"excerpt\":\"Con iOS 26.5, gli utenti iPhone in UE ottengono nuove funzioni per accessori indossabili di terze parti: pairing via prossimità, inoltro notifiche e Live Activities.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/european-union-eu-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"european-union-eu\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14768,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T09:38:15+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:38:15+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-novita-principali\",\"title\":\"iOS 26.5: tutte le novità principali\",\"excerpt\":\"iOS 26.5 introduce crittografia end-to-end per RCS tra iPhone e Android, nuove funzioni per Maps e cambiamenti UE per wearable di terze parti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14756,\"date\":\"2026-05-10T10:29:16+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-10T08:29:18+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-max-2-509-amazon-tutti-colori\",\"title\":\"AirPods Max 2 a 499 euro su Amazon in 4 colori\",\"excerpt\":\"Su Amazon è disponibile AirPods Max 2 a 509 dollari in tutte le cinque colorazioni, in calo da 549 dollari. Consegna prevista intorno al 11 maggio.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/airpods-max-2-purple-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-max-2-purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14697,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T09:00:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-fotocamere-ai-test-advanced-2\",\"title\":\"AirPods Pro con fotocamere AI: test “advanced” in corso\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, gli AirPods Pro con fotocamere integrate sono in fase di test “advanced”: design e feature set quasi definitivi, con possibile avvio della produzione iniziale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/airpods-pro-3-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-orange\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14695,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T08:35:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-wearable-tipo-airtag-fotocamere-integrazione-iphone\",\"title\":\"Apple lavora a un wearable “tipo AirTag” con fotocamere e integrazione iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman (Bloomberg), Apple continua lo sviluppo di un accessorio “pendant con fotocamere” e di smart glasses con integrazione iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14645,\"date\":\"2026-05-06T16:30:04+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-06T07:09:31+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-accelerera-phone-agenti-ai-produzione-1h27\",\"title\":\"OpenAI accelera il “phone” con agenti AI: produzione nel 1H27\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Ming-Chi Kuo, OpenAI starebbe accelerando lo sviluppo del suo primo “AI agent phone”, puntando alla produzione di massa già nella prima metà del 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/openai-logo-neon-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"openai-logo-neon\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14471,\"date\":\"2026-04-28T00:37:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-27T22:37:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-due-nuovi-prodotti-ultra\",\"title\":\"Apple: in arrivo due nuovi prodotti “Ultra”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Macworld, Apple pianifica di lanciare un “iPhone Ultra” pieghevole e un “MacBook Ultra” con display OLED e touchscreen nel prossimo anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Logo-Black-768x429.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14443,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-macbook-ultra-fino-a-sei-nuove-funzioni\",\"title\":\"Apple “MacBook Ultra”: fino a sei nuove funzioni in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple starebbe preparando un grande redesign per i MacBook Pro di fascia alta, con possibile branding “MacBook Ultra” e fino a sei nuove funzioni: OLED, touch, Dynamic Island, chip M6 Pro/M6 Max, design più sottile e connettività cellulare.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14378,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:10:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:10:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-airpods-pro-videocamere-ir-2026\",\"title\":\"Nuovi AirPods Pro con videocamere IR: cosa aspettarsi nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo indiscrezioni, Apple starebbe lavorando a una nuova variante degli AirPods Pro con piccole videocamere a infrarossi. Possibili novità su gesti, audio spaziale con Vision Pro, chip H3 e prezzi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14257,\"date\":\"2026-04-14T08:12:37+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-14T06:12:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-testa-quattro-modelli-smart-glasses-materiali-fascia-alta\",\"title\":\"Apple testa quattro modelli di smart glasses con materiali di fascia alta\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman (Bloomberg), Apple sta sviluppando almeno quattro stili di smart glasses in acetato, con integrazione stretta a iPhone e Siri e rilascio previsto tra fine 2026 e 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Glasses-Blue-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Glasses-Blue-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewC