\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Best-Apple-Deals-Feature-Shelf-0004-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Best Apple Deals Feature Shelf\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13933,\"date\":\"2026-03-15T02:30:43+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-15T12:34:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"storie-principali-apple-50-anniversario-nuovi-prodotti\",\"title\":\"Storie Principali: Il 50° Anniversario di Apple, Nuovi Prodotti e Novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo una settimana ricca di annunci, Apple ha reso disponibili i nuovi prodotti e ha avviato i preparativi per il 50° anniversario dell'azienda.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/top-stories-2026-03-14-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top stories\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13751,\"date\":\"2026-03-08T15:31:46+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-08T15:20:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-lancio-tre-nuovi-dispositivi-ultra\",\"title\":\"Apple potrebbe lanciare tre nuovi dispositivi 'Ultra' quest'anno\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple prevede di lanciare almeno tre nuovi dispositivi di classe 'Ultra' quest'anno, secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-Logo-Black-768x429.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Logo Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secu